 `game_agent_status` 的 `game_information.welcomeMessages` 和
 `welcomeContextPartsPushed` 分别记录缓存消息数和成功提交的阅读分段数。
 
diff --git a/plugin/plugins/game_agent_minecraft/docs/2026-10-09-decision-context-budget.md b/plugin/plugins/game_agent_minecraft/docs/2026-10-09-decision-context-budget.md
